<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = -----				    O/N = 2.55%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 6.38%				    T/N = 2.55%</p>
<p>		   Aug 29, 1996			 Aug 28, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  7.83%	1 month forward =  8.18%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  9.86%	2 month forward = 10.39%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.98%	3 month forward = 10.45%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward = 10.38%	4 month forward = 10.48%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 11.09%	5 month forward = 11.18%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 11.02%	6 month forward = 11.08%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
